  "commit_authority": "User requested commit-log --commit after Samsung test for each Story",
  "commit_policy": "single",
  "decisions": [
    "Ordered foods envelope with validated per-item snapshots, legacy singleton compatibility and visible rejected-member count; coherent dishes remain single foods.",
    "Select/deselect and inspect cards, random per-result generation plus ordinal IDs, ordered unsaved queue and successful-save-only acknowledgement via the production navigation helper.",
    "Cancellation returns review without saving; failure leaves the item editable and retryable. Saved items are excluded; singleTop and in-flight/completed insertion guards protect the live queue from duplicates.",
    "Busy Back/promotion is blocked using current ViewModel state. Counts explicitly describe Quick Add saves; Align remains an explicit existing alternative.",
    "FOODUS-003 hint/layout and FOODUS-005 complete nullable nutrition, explicit energy, metadata and immutable-history contracts retained. No schema migration or new dependencies.",
    "Synthetic generated JPEG, private Koin, real in-memory Room and controlled pre-insert failure/gate; no global diary/settings writes, AI calls, credentials or owner photos. Rotation policy restored.",
    "Last accepted item returns scanner summary here; FOODUS-007 owns final Log/home completion. Durable exactly-once persistence across process death is not claimed.",
    "Legacy release version retained under transition policy; no release authorized."
  ],
